_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":480,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg/1280px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg/960px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":480,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg/1280px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_%28514604857%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tel_Bet_She%27an_The_Last_Days_of_Scythopolis_sign_1291_(514604857).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=35132269","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2014-09-04 07:21:25","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Tel Bet She'an The Last Days of Scythopolis sign 1291 (514604857)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Canon PowerShot A630|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR|Scythopolis|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"GPSLatitude":{"value":"32.501365","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSLongitude":{"value":"35.502490","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p><b>The Last Days of Scythopolis</b>\n\"Roman Bet-She'an, known as Nyssa Scythopolis, became Christian, reaching its golden age in the 6th century C.E. In the 7th century, Muslims settled in the city, once again changing its character. One day in the year 749, an earthquake shook the region and the city's houses, streets, columns, and statues collapsed like a house of cards.\n\"Ancient Bet She'an lay in ruins for centuries, until archaeologists uncovered its monumental center. If a magic wand had waved away the debris, the pillars and stones could have returned to their original place. Excavations on the site have not solved the riddle: What was the fate of the residents of Bet She'an? Did some of them manage to flee from the disaster?\"<br>\n</p>\nTel Bet She'an","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2007-05-04 10:39","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/emeryjl/514604857/\">\"The Last Days of Scythopolis\" sign_1291</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/62126383@N00\">James Emery</a> from Douglasville, United States","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"35132267":{"pageid":35132267,"ns":6,"title":"File:Tel Bet She'an he Splendor of the City sign 1292 (514606807).jpg","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":3360556,"width":3264,"height":2448,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg/960px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":480,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg/1280px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg/960px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":480,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg/1280px-Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_%28514606807%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tel_Bet_She%27an_he_Splendor_of_the_City_sign_1292_(514606807).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=35132267","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2014-09-04 07:21:21","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Tel Bet She'an he Splendor of the City sign 1292 (514606807)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Canon PowerShot A630|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR|Scythopolis|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"GPSLatitude":{"value":"32.501365","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSLongitude":{"value":"35.502490","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p><b>The Splendor of the City</b>\nIn the Roman period, during the 2nd century C.E., the monumental center of Bet She'an was built into the valley at the foot of the tell. Roman style and workmanship were applied in constructing public buildings, which were adorned with the finest carving and sculpture befitting a city of the empire. The city center continued to develop and flourish in the Byzantine period and up to the destruction of the city in the earthquake of 749 C.E.<br>\n</p>\nTel Bet She'an","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2007-05-04 10:39","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/emeryjl/514606807/\">\"The Splendor of the City\" sign_1292</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/62126383@N00\">James Emery</a> from Douglasville, United States","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":